abstract: >-
  LearnWell is a macOS application for comfortable study habits, combining
  camera-based posture awareness, study and break reminders, activity history,
  and optional Arduino environment monitoring.
keywords:
  - posture detection
  - study habits
  - macOS
  - Swift
  - Arduino
